  "label": "Pun on 'in the streets' meaning",
  "description": "The phrase 'in the streets' refers to being in public or out in the open, as opposed to being indoors or in private. This pun is central to the meme's humor, contrasting it with 'in the sheets' (meaning in bed). Understanding this linguistic play is essential to grasp the joke.",
